    {
      "source": "Customization hook for creating description out of defined values.<br/>\nCalled by <a href=\"TypedJsonSchemaObject.html#toDocument()\"><code>TypedJsonSchemaObject.toDocument()</code></a> when no explicit <a href=\"TypedJsonSchemaObject.html#description(java.lang.String)\"><code>TypedJsonSchemaObject.description(String)</code></a> is set.",
      "translation": "用于从定义的值创建描述的自定义钩子。<br/>\n当未显式设置<a href=\"TypedJsonSchemaObject.html#description(java.lang.String)\"><code>TypedJsonSchemaObject.description(String)</code></a>时，由<a href=\"TypedJsonSchemaObject.html#toDocument()\"><code>TypedJsonSchemaObject.toDocument()</code></a>调用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Define the minProperties and maxProperties via the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Range.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a>.<br/>\nIn-/Exclusions via <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Range.Bound.html#isInclusive()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>range bounds</code></a> are not taken into account.",
      "translation": "通过给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Range.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a> 定义 minProperties 和 maxProperties。<br/>\n不考虑通过 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Range.Bound.html#isInclusive()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>range bounds</code></a> 进行的包含/排除。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If set to false, additional fields besides\n<a href=\"#properties(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema.JsonSchemaProperty...)\"><code>properties(JsonSchemaProperty...)</code></a>/<a href=\"#patternProperties(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema.JsonSchemaProperty...)\"><code>patternProperties(JsonSchemaProperty...)</code></a> are not allowed.",
      "translation": "如果设置为 false，则不允许除以下字段之外的其他字段：\n<a href=\"#properties(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema.JsonSchemaProperty...)\"><code>properties(JsonSchemaProperty...)</code></a>/<a href=\"#patternProperties(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema.JsonSchemaProperty...)\"><code>patternProperties(JsonSchemaProperty...)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
