      "source": "<a href=\"JsonSchemaObject.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema\"><code>JsonSchemaObject</code></a> implementation of <code>type : 'object'</code> schema elements.<br/>\nProvides programmatic access to schema specifics like required, properties, patternProperties,... via a\nfluent API producing immutable <a href=\"JsonSchemaObject.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema\"><code>schema objects</code></a>.",
      "translation": "`JsonSchemaObject` 接口的 `type : 'object'` 模式元素的实现。  \n通过流式 API 提供对模式具体细节（如 required、properties、patternProperties 等）的程序化访问，并生成不可变的<a href=\"JsonSchemaObject.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema\"><code>schema objects</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
